  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **Registers the domain database's process locks,** which the store takes for its tables: a lock file beside the database file, from Compze.Sql.Sqlite. See Compze.Teventive.MemoryImageStateStore's changelog.\n- **The tables of one memory image:** `MemoryImageStateStoreTaggregate` has no `CommitNumber` column and its `Snapshot` is never null, and `MemoryImageStateStoreCommitCounter` is gone, now that one memory image at a time uses them: see Compze.Teventive.MemoryImageStateStore's changelog. A database whose tables an earlier version created needs them dropped before this version first uses it.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Sql.Sqlite 0.7.1-alpha (was 0.6.0-alpha), Compze.Teventive.MemoryImageStateStore 0.3.0-alpha (was 0.2.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
